  "bodyHash": "f7481a53091c8ca5",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1191781/description_d9416760-a9ac-45a2-82fb-2df5fbd936d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></p>\n<h1>简介</h1>\n<p>Bakeries 是一款模组，允许你在游戏中制作并食用烘焙食品。</p>\n<h1>模组特性</h1>\n<h2>全新的烹饪机制</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1191781/description_aac42a90-d7bd-48fa-9de4-2bb869eec582.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1191781/description_084e3bcb-ec10-4750-9ca1-23426cbd536b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<h2>可放置的食物</h2>\n<p>本模组中的烘焙食品可以放置，让你更好地装饰你的世界！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1191781/description_f37d58aa-ebdd-48c5-b9a8-380ff053f311.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p>该模组引入了全新的烹饪机制，且其中的食物支持放置，助你更好地装饰游戏世界。</p>\n<h1><strong>入门指南</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>你可以打开进度页面，或查阅模组内置的教程书。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1191781/description_7125886e-786f-4301-9bfc-568ff52785d2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"246\" height=\"227\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1191781/description_d67ec936-206c-4334-88c0-82edca977975.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"249\" height=\"208\"></p>\n<h1>常见问题</h1>\n<h2>问：我可以将此模组放入我的整合包中吗？</h2>\n<p>答：当然可以！欢迎在整合包中使用 Bakeries，请记住：<br>务必注明原作者，切勿将 Bakeries 声称为你自己的创作；</p>\n<h2>问：该模组将更新到哪些 Minecraft 版本？</h2>\n<p>答：1.20.1</p>",
